    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautifully maintained three-bedroom semi-detached residence ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac within Blackthorn Hills, one of Ferrybank's most sought-after residential developments.\n\nSituated adjacent to Waterford Golf Club, the development enjoys a wonderful balance of peaceful, leafy surroundings and everyday convenience, with schools, shops and local amenities all within easy reach. Waterford City Centre is just 2km away, while excellent road connectivity is provided by easy access to the M9, N25 and Waterford Outer Ring Road, making the property particularly appealing to commuters.\n\nExtending to approximately 120sq m, the spacious accommodation is well laid out and comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, generous sitting room with double doors opening into the kitchen/dining room, utility room, guest WC and a separate living room on the ground floor. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from private driveway parking to the front, while the rear offers a generous private garden with patio area, providing an attractive and versatile outdoor space for relaxing, entertaining and al fresco dining.\n\nFurther features include gas-fired central heating, a water softener system and PVC double-glazed windows.\n\nCombining generous accommodation, a desirable residential setting and excellent connectivity, this superb home represents an ideal opportunity for families, professionals and those seeking a quality home close to Waterford City.\nViewings can be arranged through Sole Agents Barry Murphy Auctioneers.\n\nGround Floor\nEntrance Hall: 4.88m x 2.02m. Tiled floor.\nSitting Room: 5.62m x 4.07m. Wood floor, blinds, fireplace with Henley stove, double doors to\nKitchen/Diner: 3.7m x 5.31m. Tiled floor, fitted kitchen with island.\nUtility Room: 2.63m x 0.81m. Tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine, door to garden.\nLiving Room: 3.21m x 4.69m. Wood floor, blinds, French doors to rear garden.\nWC: 2.08m x 1.46m. Tiled floor, WC, wash hand basin.\nFirst Floor\nMaster Bedroom: 4.21m x 3.09m. Laminate floor, blinds, fitted wardrobes.\nEn-suite: 2.55m x 0.97m. Fully tiled, WC, wash hand basin, electric shower.\nBedroom 2: 3.77m x 3.05m. Laminate floor, blinds, fitted wardrobes.\nBedroom 3: 2.6m x 3.04m. Carpet, blinds, built in bed.\nBathroom: 2.57m x 1.89m. Fully tiled, WC, wash hand basin with vanity unit, bath."
      },
